        "\n",
        "### 🧭 Strategic Takeaway\n",
        "\n",
        "To align with market demands:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Focus learning on **SQL, Python, and Excel** early.\n",
        "\n",
        "- Target **AI job hubs** or seek remote roles in active states.\n",
        "\n",
        "- Build a portfolio with **projects**, **internships**, or **competitions**.\n",
